window.products.push({"id":591118,"name":"Kangler Automatic Soap Dispenser Wall Mount, 700ml Liquid Soap Dispenser for Kitchen Bathroom Hotel Commercial","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EPnZslrdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Kangler Wall Mounted Touchless Sensor Auto Soap Dispenser will be your best choice of hygienic solution - a must-have for your loving home or hotel and other public places. Features: - The Kangler soap dispensing pump uses Infrared Sensor Technology to ensures a consistent and even amount of soap every time.It single out the liquid 0.8~1ml,avoid unnecessary waste. - Electronics LAB mature technological achievement, Infrared sensing device through no less than 300,000 times uninterrupted use test. Specifications: Material: ABS Conttainer Capacity: 700ml/24oz Sensor Range: <10cm(6.5 inch) Dispensing Volume: 0.8~1ml per activation Power Supply: 4 x AA Alkaline Batteries (Not included) Installation Instruction: 1. Choose a suitable position to mount the dispenser on the wall, sensor system is at the bottom of the dispenser; please keep 50cm free space at least under the sensor system. 2. Slide the fix plate out of the dispenser, use this plate as a template to mark three drill spots. 3. Drill two 5mm holes, and then insert the platic plugs. 4. Fix the plate on the wall qith two screws then slide the dispenser in the plate. 5. Insert 4pcs\"AA\" batteries into the battery compartment according to the diagram indication. 6. Open the container lid. 7. Fill in liquid. 8. Turn on switch. Tips: At the first use, since the liquid has not completely flows through thw pipe, may not liquid at first, please try several times Package list: - 1 x Automatic Soap Dispenser - 1 x Installation Screw Set - 1 x User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EPnZslrdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kangler","source_asin":"B07VRDN9HC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-591118","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VRDN9HC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VRDN9HC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
