window.products.push({"id":591247,"name":"Clear Christmas Ornaments,Christmas Balls,Clear Plastic Fillable Ornaments for Xmas Tree Decorations Holiday Outside Decorations DIY Mini Resin Access","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81otId53kaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Great Value Set ：15pcs clear plastic fillable ornaments(1.57\"/40MM) with15pcs resin christmas ornaments（ santa claus, christmas trees, snowmen, christmas snow houses, reindeer, christmas ducks, christmas socks, merry christmas signs, christmas gift boxes）and 15 gold strands (7.8\"/20cm). Safe Material: Clear plastic ornaments are made of high quality plastic material, reusable clear balls, easy to change theme, combine the beauty and luster of real glass with the unbreakable practicality of plastic. The Christmas stuffing is made of resin with bright colors, it is safe to use and not easy to fade and break. Comes with gold embroidery thread for easy connection. Wide Application:The christmas ball set can be applied to christmas tree decorations, christmas wreath decorations, holiday gifts, fairy igloo decorations,DIY, diy snow globes, commercial holiday decorations and plant decorations, etc. it is also dazzling when viewed up close and fits most size christmas trees. Christmas Gift: The perfect gift to decorate the christmas tree, create your child's fairy garden, dollhouse with your family or friends. diy these gadgets will develop and enhance children's creativity and imagination, it will make the holiday life more colorful. kids and adults, even your neighbors will love watching this vibrant christmas ball decoration. enjoy a hassle-free vacation! Reminder: Each transparent refillable ball can be divided into two parts for easy opening and loading into the model. Hang a piece of gold embroidery thread through the loop for an easy decoration. The ball has 2 opposing sides, 16 male hemispheres and 16 female hemispheres. Make sure you choose a male and a female side so you can match a ball. (There will be an extra ball in our kit for you to DIY)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81otId53kaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AE LIFE","source_asin":"B0B8ML3L9F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-591247","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8ML3L9F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8ML3L9F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":591248,"name":"Big Dot of Happiness Party Like a Panda Bear - Birthday Party Bunting Banner - Birthday Party Decorations - Happy Birthday","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Mo1Rq70XL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Satin Party Like a Panda Bear Bunting Banner is an impressive birthday decoration for your party. Panda Birthday Bunting Banner Decoration Kit INCLUDES Party Like a Panda Bear HAPPY BIRTHDAY letter pennants, panda themed pennants, satin ribbon and non-marking wall mounts for hanging. Party Like a Panda Bear Bunting Banners SIZE: Each pennant measures 8.5 inches high x 5.5 inches wide. Ribbon measures 24 feet long and 3/8 inch wide. BIRTHDAY PARTY DECORATIONS: A Party Like a Panda Bear or Birthday Party Bunting Banner is an easy way to decorate for your party and bring your panda theme to life. Hang at the entrance of your birthday party, over the food table or candy buffet, at the gift table or behind the head table. PREMIUM BIRTHDAY PARTY SUPPLIES: Party Like a Panda Bear Bunting Banner is professionally printed on sturdy cardstock paper. Each pennant is individually inspected then carefully packaged by hand. Panda birthday bunting banners require some easy assembly. Following the number sequence on the back of each pennant, simply string the included satin ribbon through the pennant slots. Create multiple rows by cutting the ribbon to your desired length or hang as one long banner. MADE IN THE USA: Party Like a Panda Bear - Birthday Party Bunting Banner is designed and manufactured at our Wisconsin facility using materials that are Made in the USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Mo1Rq70XL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Big Dot of Happiness","source_asin":"B07FPQRN9N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-591248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FPQRN9N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FPQRN9N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
