window.products.push({"id":591252,"name":"16\" x 24\" Rectangle Clear Tempered Glass Table Top 3/8\" Thick - Flat Polish Edge","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":84.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41E2SXDOm0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"16\" x 24\" RECTANGLE GLASS TOPS Features: Finest quality furniture glass. Edges and corners expertly polished. Expertly packed to ensure safe arrival. Glass is individually cartoned with styrofoam protection. Free bumpons included to place between glass tops & base. 16\" x 24\" RECTANGLE GLASS TOPS The 16\" x 24\"\" Rectangle Glass top has a thickness of 3/8 inch. This clear glass table top is made from the finest quality furniture glass. The corners are flat polished with touch corners and a weight of 14 lbs. The glass table edges and corners are expertly polished for a beautiful and quality look - plus, it's tempered at no additional cost!The rectangle glass tops are good for replacement glass or to give any coffee, side board, or hallway table a new look and feel. This clear glass rectangle top is good for protecting table tops while still being stylish. Glass top tables have a variety of uses in the home so it is one of the more popular items used for home decorating today. The bevel edges give a new distinctive look while complimenting the original piece. The rectangle glass tops can be used as decoration for an event to give the tables an elegant look.Each beautiful rectangle glass top comes with free bumpons that are placed between the glass and the base of the table to protect them. The glass tops are also professionally packed in their own individual cartons with styrofoam to help protect from breakage during shipment. The 16\" x 24\" rectangle glass top will be sent quickly via FedEx or common carrier and is insured to for a safe arrival.Shopping for rectangle glass tops is easy at Glass Tops Direct. We offer a wide selection of various thicknesses, edge work and even custom sizes. Our catalog includes an extensive inventory of many other shapes for glass tops as well such as, round, square, oval and even boat sha","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41E2SXDOm0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spancraft Glass","source_asin":"B01L2UMY7S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-591252","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01L2UMY7S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01L2UMY7S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
