window.products.push({"id":591551,"name":"Essential Oil Diffuser - Aromatherapy Cool Mist Humidifier for Bedroom Simulated Flame Night Light Aroma Diffuser Auto Shut Off 3 Timer Mode Whisper Q","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Wig7K7BjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Information Humidifier The desk humidifier spreads mist across the surroundings consistently, which lowers the dryness of the air and increases the humidity level. It prevents problems like dry skin and nasal bleeding from occurring.  Auto-off Aromatherapy Air Humidifier automatically shut down according to your adjustment hour. The diffuser also would power off when the it run out of the water.  Portable The humidifier's size is small and is lightweight, making it highly portable. You can carry it to your office, on your travel and camping adventures.  Notice 1.Please add water below the maximum line, otherwise it will affect the mist or block the mist outlet. 2.Do not open the diffuser cover when use. 3.Use clean water before use. Clean the diffuser at least once a week and do not leave water or moisture in the oil diffuser.  Instruction 1.Turn on-Press the switch button once, the humidifier starts to spraying and golden light is on. The default is not timed. 2.Adjust timer setting mode - Keep the humidifier staying on, double-click the button of the humidifier. It will automatically turn on the corresponding white light under the hour. It will according to your adjustment hour automatically shut down. If you don’t need to fixed it, just double-click the key timing again. 3.Adjust light - Keep the humidifier staying on, long press the button 1.5 seconds, the golden light turns blue. And then press the button for 1.5 seconds to turn off the light. 4.Turn off- Press once the button and turn off the humidifier. 5.Adjust light when the humidifier is power off, long press the button1.5 seconds, the golden light on. Then Long press the key 1.5 seconds, the golden light turns blue light. Long press 1.5 seconds again, light off. 6.The humidifier will automatically turn off when it run out of the water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Wig7K7BjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0B38629PS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-591551","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B38629PS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B38629PS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
