window.products.push({"id":591558,"name":"My Favorite People Call Me PawPaw Stainless Steel Engraved Insulated Tumbler 20 Oz Travel Coffee Mug, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MgluM94lL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"This double-walled stainless steel travel mug can be used for all types of holidays gifts including Christmas, Birthdays, Father's Day, Mother's Day, Valentines Day, Weddings, Anniversaries, Pregancy Announcements, Grandparents to be, Baby Showers, and more. The mug has a narrower bottom to fit most standard cup holders, Double-wall vacuum insulation with a clear lid. Not recommended for dishwashers, hand wash only. Holds up to 20-ounces of liquid. Do not use in a microwave.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MgluM94lL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CustomGiftsNow","source_asin":"B07Q26ZCVF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-591558","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q26ZCVF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q26ZCVF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":591559,"name":"Lifeline 7512 Silver Stainless Steel Vacuum Insulated Double Wall Bottle Style Growler - 750ml. Capacity","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613YSq5CakL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Our Chardonnay inspired 750 mL DOUBLE-WALL WINE GROWLER is VACUUM-INSULATED to keep wine at the perfect temperature all day. Amazon.com Lifeline knows the importance of safety when enjoying the great outdoors or open highway. Because adventures don’t always go the way we plan, Lifeline manufactures the best in outdoor and road safety products to help keep you prepared for those unforeseen disasters. Double-walled, vacuum-insulated growler keeps beverages hot or cold all day Lifeline’s 50/50 Double-Wall Growler is vacuum-insulated to keep liquids hot or cold all day. The Stainless Steel Growler holds 64oz. of your favorite beverage and in most cases can keep hot liquids hot and cold liquids cold for more than 12 hours. Double-wall technology also serves another very important purpose, it prevents condensation on the exterior of the bottle as well as any kind of temperature transfer from whichever type of beverage the bottle is holding, regardless of whether it is hot or cold. Lifeline stainless steel bottles are constructed from lightweight 18/8 stainless steel that is 100% recyclable, BPA-Free, and requires no lining. Stainless steel growlers also will not retain odor or taste. How Does It Work? Lifeline’s Vacuum Insulated double wall growlers keep liquids hot and cold through using the best insulation technologies available. Instead of simply using foam insulation, or using a simple double wall construction, Lifeline’s 50/50 growlers are vacuum insulated between the two layers of the stainless steel water bottles. A vacuum is a space that contains no atoms which in turn eliminates conduction and convection allowing for the beverage inside to stay hot or cold depending on what you have put in there. The main reason the beverages can’t retain their temperature for even longer being that some temperature leak does occur through the lid of the bottle. Most cheaper, imitation knock-off stainless steel bottles solely utilize a double wall technique, that is great for reducing condensation on the exterior for the bottle, but does very little toward actually helping beverages to retain their temperatures. About Lifeline For over 16 years, Lifeline has provided unique roadside emergency kits, first aid kits, outdoor survival kits and hydration products from its headquarters in Portland, OR. Lifeline started as a small first aid kit manufacturer in 1996 and have expanded to sell a broad range of outdoor, safety and disaster preparedness products to some of the largest retailers in the country. Lifeline also makes private labeled kits for specialty retailers and major car manufacturers worldwide. But, no matter how much Lifeline grows, the goals remain unchanged; to provide quality products, unique items and exceptional customer service at a value price. As a result of high standards for quality and service, Lifeline has earned awards from some of the largest corporations in the world. In 2007, Lifeline received an \"Excellent Quality Award\" from Toyota, which is given to suppliers who provide OEM parts for an entire year without a single recorded defect. Also, in continued support of a commitment to quality, Lifeline is ISO 9001 certified.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613YSq5CakL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lifeline","source_asin":"B00L45Z5UA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-591559","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00L45Z5UA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00L45Z5UA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":591560,"name":"7oz Plastic Martini Glasses for Parties,72 pack Clear Plastic Martini Glasses,Mini Dessert Cups,Clear Plastic Wine Glasses,Plastic Cocktail Glasses","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V-KjwxZcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Specification: 7 Oz plastic martini glass x60pcs Color: Clear Material: PS Product Description: Brand:SUPERNAL is new and our goods are also unique which will left deep impression to you.We hope you can have a good dinner time and enjoy the party with your family and friend.The most important is that our goods will save the time for you to order. Recyclable and BPA Free : The plastic martini glass set are healthy and safety to any kind of food.They are BPA free. We use the 100% pure PS material to the goods. PACKAGE : Clear disposable martini glass are packed in a sturdy gift box, 60  pieces clear martini glass will be not damage in transit. BEST CUSTOMER SERVE : If you have any question, please contact us in time by email, we will reply you as soon as possible. Perfect for any occasion: This disposable clear martini glass are simply dazzling with a universal appeal that will complement your any party theme.These heavyweight plastic martini glass are designed to withstand even the most temperature intensive foods while maintaining their form and shape. They will last through the entire meal till they are thrown out, or washed and reused for the next meal. Save clean-up time by throwing them out after use, while still enjoying the decorative and elegant accent they add to your event. NOTE & TIPS: Please don't put them in dishwasher and microwave. If you try to keep and reuse them, please hand wash and dry them after using , Stored in dry place for its durability.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V-KjwxZcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"supernal","source_asin":"B08X4L1C65","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-591560","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X4L1C65","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X4L1C65","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
