window.products.push({"id":591566,"name":"Green Table Runner 16x120 Inch Sequin Mesh Roll Runner Glitter Table Lines for Wedding Birthday Party Home Decorations","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91uoLVSKfxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★★Welcome to SoarDream★★ Are you looking for green table runner to decorate your parties? Our glitter table runner is the best choice for you. The green mesh table runner offers a luxurious effect that is going to make your special moments even more memorable. Packing Include: 1 pcs sequin woven table runner. Material: Made of 50% Polyester & 50% PVC. Sizes: 16x120 Inches. This weave design is stunning and brings elegance to the table. It’s quite long and would work on almost any length table. It has plastic sequins interwoven throughout providing just the right amount of sparkle making it a unique addition to your decor. This shiny table runner is perfect for wedding, home decor, bridal shower, baby shower, anniversary, birthday parties, holiday, barbecue evenings, dining table, coffee table, tea table, storage table, picnic table, kitchen, dresser, piano, studio, also suitable for both indoor and outdoor occasions. ABOUT US:SoarDream manufacturer integrates Production, Sales and Service. We have our own material factory and processing factory. Factory Direct Prices. We support wholesale, the more you buy, the lower the price. Various of table runner: gold table runner, mesh table runner, glitter table runner, sequin table runner, sequin oven table lines, mesh roll table runner, elegant Table Runner, sparkly table runner, party table runner,wedding table linen, baby shower table decorations, birthday party table runner,gold theme party table runner, romantic table runner, indoor and outdoor table decorations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91uoLVSKfxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SoarDream","source_asin":"B081CSQJ71","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-591566","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081CSQJ71","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081CSQJ71","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":591567,"name":"Grand Rapids Michigan Skyline by Michael Tompsett, 30x47-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":80.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KPHnfJc-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery wrapped art piece features a colorful watercolor skyline of grand Rapids, Michigan. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies. After 12 years Michael Topsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Athrough Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, hi main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Tompsett creates Urban landmark and cityscape designs. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KPHnfJc-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B017NGYIUQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-591567","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017NGYIUQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017NGYIUQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
