window.products.push({"id":591750,"name":"Grsolul Ergonomic Mesh Office Chair - High-Back Computer Desk Chairs with Adjustable Lumbar Support, Headrest and Footrest - Comfortable Task Chair, G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614uo9AP--L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【ADJUSTABLE MESH CHAIR】Equipped with excellent adjustable system which includes adjustable headrest, lumbar support, seat height adjustment, swivel, and tilt mechanism. Concealed retractable footrest. Premium castor wheels that glide over all types of surfaces easily. 【ERGONOMIC BACKREST & SEAT】Generous seat and backrest dimensions that even tall users will find comfortable, adjustable lumbar support can perfectly fit your spine and significantly ease the fatigue and pain of your back, the large contoured back and headrest that naturally fits the shape of most people. 【UNIQUE HEADREST & QUALITY MESH】Unlike other high back office chairs' small headrest, our big curved mesh headrest provides more comfortable neck and head support. The breathable mesh back on this ergonomic chair provides support and allows air, body heat, and water vapor to pass through the backrest to help maintain even and comfortable skin temperatures. 【CHAIR MEASUREMENTS】Overall: 44.4\" - 47.6\" * 24.8\" * 23.5(H * W * D). Seat height adjust: 16.8\" - 20\" . Seat area: 19.3\" * 20\" . Backrest area: 20\" * 27.6\" . Footrest area: 15\" * 18.1\" . SGS certificated gas lift cylinder, 5-Point Base with dual castors, 90 degree to 135 degree tilt lock, 4 inches molded foam seat cushion, 230LB Maximum Load. 【WARRANTY】We provide 30 days money-back guarantee, one year warranty and professional after sales service for our ergonomic office chair. If there is any quality problem, please contact us and we will provide you a 100% satisfied solution. This easy assembly ergonomic computer chair has comprehensive packaging with clear instructions; therefore, no need to worry damage or assembly issues.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614uo9AP--L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grsolul","source_asin":"B091DZM4LJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-591750","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091DZM4LJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091DZM4LJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":591751,"name":"KES Bathroom Shelves Industrial Pipe Shelving Pipe Shelves 24-Inch Shelves with Bar Industrial for Wall Bathroom Rustic Farmhouse 2 Tier Iron Wall Mou","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fuOLI5jCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EPA & CARB Certified Particleboards: Unlike other similar wooden shelves that use fragile wooden boards, KES adapts the 0.6\" thick, certified particleboards for ensuring durability and deformed resistance. In addition, our particleboards are certified by EPA and CARB so you can rest assured to use this heavy-duty pipe shelf. The unique retro texture of this industrial pipe shelving unit will bring you surprise and adds country-style chic to your living space! Firm & Stable Structure: The industrial shelf consists of high-quality particleboards & firm metal pipes so the structure of the entire unit is very sturdy. The flat flanges adhere to the wall with 2.4\" (60mm) long black stainless steel self-tapping screws, which ensure stability and load capacity. The maximum load of each tier is 44lbs/20kg so this shelf holds up to a total of 88lbs/40kg. Create Storage Space: The overall dimensions are 24\" L x 8\" W x 29\" H (60 x 20 x 74cm). This bathroom shelf with towel bar makes great use of any wall to create storage space. In addition, the open storage design is convenient for easily accessing items without scratching your hands. Easy to Install: All installation components are included and some pipes are pre-assembled for you so it is simple to install on your own. Follow the included instructions to assemble pipes and particleboards, and tighten the entire shelf to the wall with the heavy-duty screws. This bathroom towel shelf is then ready to use! Multi-purpose: This 2-tier black pipe shelf with towel bar is primarily intended for use in a bathroom and provides a convenient place to store toilet paper, hand towels, plants, or other items. You can also use it in kitchens, living rooms, laundry rooms, or farmhouse-style rooms.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fuOLI5jCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KES","source_asin":"B0BR3GZR6C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-591751","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR3GZR6C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR3GZR6C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
