window.products.push({"id":591863,"name":"Arus Women's Soft Touch Turkish Velour Cotton Fleece Bath Towel Wrap P/S Royal Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611sh+-KTwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Arus Women's Adjustable Hook and Loop Closure on Chest Turkish Velour Cotton Fleece Bath Towel Wrap Our softest Bath Wrap ever! You may now enjoy the softness of fleece to go with the absorbency of world famous Turkish toweling. This functional, absorbent and soft Bath Spa Shower Towel Wrap is made of plush velour fleece material for extreme softness on the outside and Terry Cotton on the inside for great absorbency. Made in Turkey with high quality Turkish cotton by Arus. This wrap is perfect for spa, travel, sauna, beach and fitness. You can take your wrap anywhere you go. Hook and Loop Closing for better fitting allows you to adjust your wrap based on your preference. Washing Instructions: Please wash and dry with the Hook and Loop Closed to keep your wrap in its original condition. Sizing Information: Available in Sizes P/S, S/M and L/XL Detailed Bath Wrap Length / Circumference information: Size Petite/Small : 28\" / 53\" Size Small/Medium : 30\" / 59\" Size Large/XL: 33\" / 61\" What is so special about Turkish bath wraps and bathrobes ? There are different qualities of cotton used in bathrobes and wraps. The highest quality is called the High Grade Cotton known for its softness. Turkish bathrobes and bath wraps are manufactured from the highest grade cotton with extra long fibers grown in the Aegean region resulting in unmatched absorbency, therefore; it is important to buy a 'Turkish Terry Cotton' bathrobe or shower wrap to get the highest quality when shopping for a long lasting robe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611sh+-KTwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Arus","source_asin":"B01N2KJQ56","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-591863","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N2KJQ56","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N2KJQ56","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
