window.products.push({"id":591996,"name":"CrystalAge Gold Sheen Obsidian Palm Stone","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v-K1jJj7L._SL1296_.jpg","description":"This beautiful variety of obsidian is formed when tiny gas bubbles are trapped in the still-forming crystal. Our Gold Sheen Obsidian Palm Stone has been expertly polished to bring out the natural beauty of the crystal. Like all obsidians, this variety is grounding and dissolves fear. It is also considered the best obsidian for scrying and crystallomancy, its subtle shimmer said to reveal the past, present and future. Carry this stone on you, and if you feel stressed or tired, simply hold the stone to feel soothed, revived and confident once more. Product Code: PS70 Size: Width: 5.0cm (2.0\") Depth: 1.0cm (0.4\") Length: 7.0cm (2.8\") Birth Signs: Capricorn December 21st - January 19th Chakra: Root (Muladhar or Base Chakra) Stone Types: \t \t Obsidian","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v-K1jJj7L._SL1296_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CrystalAge","source_asin":"B003TTBRIS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-591996","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003TTBRIS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003TTBRIS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
